{
  "name": "4. Hyper-Personalized Email Generator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "event": "rowUpdated",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "Raw Leads"
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-trigger",
      "name": "On Lead Qualified",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json['Qualification Status'] }}",
              "operation": "equals",
              "value2": "Qualified"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json['Email Subject'] }}",
              "operation": "isEmpty"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-qualified",
      "name": "Filter: Qualified + No Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate a personalized cold email for an automation agency to a potential client.\n\nLEAD INFORMATION:\n- First Name: {{ $json['First Name'] }}\n- Company: {{ $json['Company Name'] }}\n- Job Title: {{ $json['Job Title'] }}\n- Industry: {{ $json['Industry'] }}\n- Pain Points: {{ $json['Pain Points Identified'] }}\n- Automation Opportunities: {{ $json['Automation Opportunities'] }}\n- Recent Context: {{ $json['Qualification Notes'] }}\n\nYOUR TASK:\nGenerate a cold email (80-100 words) that:\n\n1. Opens with specific reference to their company/situation (use pain points or context)\n2. Identifies the operational challenge they likely face\n3. Offers automation solution relevant to their industry\n4. Includes brief proof/example (case study or result)\n5. Ends with soft question CTA (not pushy)\n\nSTYLE GUIDELINES:\n- Conversational, not corporate\n- Confident but humble\n- No hype words (revolutionary, game-changing, etc.)\n- No spam trigger words (free, urgent, act now, etc.)\n- Sound like a helpful peer, not a salesperson\n\nEMAIL STRUCTURE:\n\nSubject: [Personalized subject referencing their specific situation]\n\nHi {{ $json['First Name'] }},\n\n[Opening line - reference specific observation about their company]\n\n[Articulate the pain point/challenge they likely feel]\n\n[Brief value proposition - how automation solves it]\n\n[Quick proof - case study or result for similar company]\n\n[Soft CTA - question, not pushy request]\n\nBest,\nIzzy\nAutomation Agency\n\n---\nThis is a business inquiry. Reply \"stop\" to unsubscribe.\nAutomation Agency | 1234 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\nReturn as JSON:\n{\n  \"subject\": \"...\",\n  \"body\": \"...\"\n}\n\nDO NOT include footer in body (will be added automatically).\nDO NOT use {{first_name}} placeholders - use the actual name."
      },
      "id": "ai-chain",
      "name": "AI Email Generator",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.8
        }
      },
      "id": "openai-model",
      "name": "ChatGPT Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchema": "={\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"subject\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"body\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"subject\", \"body\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "output-parser",
      "name": "Parse Email Output",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "Raw Leads"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Email Subject": "={{ $json.output.subject }}",
            "Email Body": "={{ $json.output.body }}",
            "Email Status": "Ready"
          },
          "matchingColumns": ["Lead ID"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "update-sheets",
      "name": "Save Generated Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [900, 300]
    }
  ],
